  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Georgia Energy Programme Phase II (2020-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project includes capacity development of energy authorities, tools for long-term energy system planning and modelling and better forecasting and integration of wind energy, improved secondary legislation and the use of experience in energy savings obligation schemes as well as strengthening the enabling environment for implementation of Georgia&#x2019;s green energy transition and related investments.  The outcome aims at assisting Georgia in its green transition and support it in living up to EU standards within the energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
